$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Alpha Maxis\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Mr Sunshine is feeling pretty good today\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Noon\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The Blood Eagle and Diamond Sword are at it again. This time, they have gone TOO far.Each team has massive bases, with strong defense.If you get through, you are a war hero. If you don't...\n\n<f0>NOTE:<f0> I would like to thank KnightSpy, Synge, Battle Angel, and Snake Eyes X for helping me with this map. If you see them, you'd better stand down.\n\n<f0>                              Watch for more maps created by Method Man, Coming Soon!\n\n                                                       Now Come Get Some...";
